<div class="htmxdemo-boost">
  <p>{{ 'The links in the boosted navigation block go to ordinary article pages. None of those pages, or the server, does anything special for htmx.'|t }}</p>
  <p>{{ 'With boost, a click fetches the page in the background and swaps in its body. The URL and title update, and Back and Forward work. The browser does not reload the page, its CSS or its JavaScript.'|t }}</p>
  <p>{{ 'To see the difference, open your browser developer tools on the Network tab and click a link. A boosted click is a single fetch request with an HX-Boosted header. Without JavaScript, the same links are plain page loads.'|t }}</p>
</div>
